# Checks that every `file:line` citation in aot_helpers.def (the AOT helper ABI
# table) and FrameEnds.def (the frame exit paths) points at a line that exists.
# Citations rot when the cited file shrinks; source-citations.py documents
# what it can and cannot catch. FrameEnds.def's shape is also static_asserted
# by the escape analysis self-test.
#
# RUN: python3 %S/source-citations.py %{monorepo}/ctbrowser/include/ctbrowser/aot/aot_helpers.def %{monorepo}
# RUN: python3 %S/source-citations.py %S/../../include/ctcompile/JavaScript/FrameEnds.def %{monorepo}
